# caption: Admit a foreign declaration with a complete supported boundary contract.

REQUIRE declaration, target ABI, supported conversion and lifetime policies
ENSURE wrapper plan or explicit unsupported-contract diagnostic
validate parameter/result types and calling convention
FORALL pointer-like parameters DO
  require extent units, null policy, direction, and lifetime policy
END FOR
identify callbacks, reentrancy, thread restrictions, and retained references
identify the error channel and output validity on failure
reject requirements without an implemented conversion or cleanup path
return the admitted plan and its assumptions

